        {"zh": "木头关节醒了", "en": "These wooden joints woke up."},
        {"zh": "灯亮了一下我就来了", "en": "One flicker of the light and I am here."},
        {"zh": "谁把门打开了", "en": "Who opened the door?"},
        {"zh": "我落地很轻", "en": "I landed softly."},
        {"zh": "这地方太小", "en": "This place is too small."},
        {"zh": "我在找你的味道", "en": "I am searching for your scent."},
        {"zh": "我的钩子还在", "en": "My hook is still here."},
        {"zh": "走廊变得很长", "en": "The corridor feels longer now."},
        {"zh": "你听见木板响了吗", "en": "Did you hear the boards creak?"}
      ]
    },
